        example: "Problem 1: A bookshelf has 5 shelves. Each shelf has 9 books. How many books in total?\n→ 5 × 9 = 45 books! 📚\n\nProblem 2: A bus has 12 rows of seats. Each row has 4 seats. How many people can sit?\n→ 12 × 4 = 48 people! 🚌\n\nProblem 3: Meera buys 7 packets of stickers. Each packet has 6 stickers. She gives 10 stickers to her friend. How many does she have left?\n→ Total: 7 × 6 = 42 stickers\n→ Left: 42 - 10 = 32 stickers! ✨\n\nProblem 4: A farmer plants 8 rows of mango trees. He puts 8 trees in each row. If each tree gives 50 mangoes, how many mangoes will he get?\n→ Trees: 8 × 8 = 64 trees\n→ Mangoes: 64 × 50 = 3,200 mangoes! 🥭",
